@baseUrl = http://localhost:53425
@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN
@eventId = 1

### Login as attendee (change email to owner.demo or organizer.demo for their views)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "attendee.demo@spacehub.example",
  "password": "SpaceHubDemo!2026"
}

### Public events: copy an actual ID; IDs are not fixed by the seed
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/events
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Attendee tickets
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me/registrations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Owner's bookings awaiting a decision (requires owner token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me/received-bookings?status=Pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Organizer's events, including private and draft (requires organizer token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me/events
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Detail includes private access code only for its organizer
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/events/{{eventId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Organizer's attendee list
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/events/{{eventId}}/attendees
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
